{"ref":"BDB, אָסֹף","hw":"אָסֹף","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אָסֹף</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] what is gathered, <strong>store</strong>, hence <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית הָאֲסֻפִּים</span> <em>store-house</em>, near south gate of temple <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.15\">1 Ch 26:15</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:24\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.24\">2 Ch 25:24</a>); v <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.17\">17</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">הָא׳</span> alone in same sense; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲכֻפֵּי הַשְּׁעָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:25\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.25\">Ne 12:25</a>.","next":"BDB, אֲסֵפָה","prev":"BDB, אָסִיף"}